      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The results of rest blood-equilibrium radionuclide ventriculography (RVG) and of coronary arteriography were reviewed together. In 12 angiographically proved CAD patients, Fourier analysis correctly diagnosed 11, with an accuracy of 83.33% in localization 9 patients with myocardial infarction showed \"empty\" area in phase images. The phase analysis in RVG was considered a sensitive and accurate method in evaluating patients of CAD."},
